    <description><![CDATA[
## OmniEdge Desktop

OmniEdge Desktop is a graphical application for creating secure, peer-to-peer mesh VPN connections for AI, robotics, and edge computing.

### Features

- **Easy-to-use interface**: Intuitive GUI for managing VPN connections
- **System tray integration**: Quick access from your taskbar
- **Peer-to-peer connections**: Direct device-to-device communication
- **Mesh networking**: Automatic network topology management
- **Cross-platform**: Works on Windows, macOS, and Linux
- **Secure**: Built on WireGuard protocol

### Getting Started

1. Launch OmniEdge Desktop from the Start Menu
2. Sign in with your OmniEdge account
3. Select a virtual network to join
4. Click Connect

### Documentation

For more information, visit [https://connect.omniedge.io/docs](https://connect.omniedge.io/docs)
]]></description>
